<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n29866" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔᾰρ</span></b>  (B) or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἶᾰρ</span></b>  (<i><span class="en">
			Hsch.
		</span></i>
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἦαρ</span></b> , <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἴαρα</span></b> ), τό, in <i><span class="en">
			Alex.
		</span></i> Poets, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>blood</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λύθρῳ τε καὶ εἴαρι πεπλήθασι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Call.
				</span></i>
			<i>Fr.anon.</i><i><span class="en">
				20
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Αἰακίδαο εἴαρος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Euph.
					39.3
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ δ᾽ ἐκ μέλαν εἶαρ ἔλαπτεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Call.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					247
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Al.</u>
				314
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>H.</u>
				2.618
			</span></i>; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰαροπότης,
			εἰαροπῶτις</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>juice</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἶαρ ἐλαίης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nic.
					<u>Al.</u>
					87
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ λύχνου πῖον ἔλειξαν ἔαρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Call.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					201
				</span></i>
			. (<i><span class="en">
				Cypr.
			</span></i> acc. to <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>; identified with <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔαρ</span>
			<i>spring</i>, by <i><span class="en">
				<u>EM</u>
				307.44
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i>; cf. Skt. <i>ásṛk</i>, gen.
				<i>asnás</i>, Lett. <i>asinis</i>
		'blood'.)</div>
